{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/28/1667110/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てぃーちゃんゆっちゃんと\n少し前に大阪(ユニバ)と京都に\n行ってきました～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近この3人＋純奈で仲良いよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと行きたかった車折神社にも\n行ってきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/28/1667110/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい時から芸能界に憧れてた私は\n高校1年生の夏に実は1度訪れていて\nお礼参りを出来ていなかったので\n遅くなってしまったけど\n神様にお礼を伝えてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/28/1667110/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その他に、嵐山や清水寺や伏見稲荷など\n京都の観光名所をまわりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣って可愛いけどやっぱり大変。\n昔の人は凄いなあと改めて思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/28/1667110/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/28/1667110/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニバにも行きました！\n私は絶叫が苦手なのでハリドリや\nフライングダイナソーはお休み！\n終わってから会う2人の表情は\n充実感に満ち溢れていて\n乗ればよかったかなあ～と少し後悔。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも高いのダメなんだよ～～(;_;)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/28/1667110/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その間に私はキャラグリ充実させてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくにミニオンのボブに会えたのは\n本当に幸せだった～～\nボブ大好き～～(;_;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/28/1667110/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/28/1667110/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばあ～～な～～なあ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達と旅行はほとんどしたことなくて\n3回中2回がゆっちゃん☻(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっちゃんもてぃーちゃんも\nハッピーな人達だから一緒にいて\nとっても楽しいんだ～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年中にもう一度旅行できますよーに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/28/1667110/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎かりんちゃんが夏祭りに行ったら絶対買うものってなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→んー夏祭り行かないから\n分からないけど食べたいと思うのは\nブルーハワイかき氷練乳がけ！\nそれで、ベロをべーってしたい！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の金つぶに美彩さんの代打で\n出演させていただきます～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマは\n「リオ五輪の楽しみ方」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひメールお待ちしています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しく座談会しましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/28/1667110/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}